msgstr ""
"Membetulkan panggilan suara dan video yang tidak berfungsi dalam binaan "
"pengeluaran (pemalam penindasan hingar hilang)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:297
msgid ""
"Fixed voice and video calls showing \"Your browser doesn't support calling\""
